MINIPROJECT 6
"Electricity bill prediction using NEURAL NETWORKS"
Project overview:
   This project predicts the monthly electricity bill using a Neural Network model built with TensorFlow and Keras.
   A simple Streamlit web application allows users to enter electricity consumption details and view the estimated bill.
Objectives:
   Predict monthly electricity bills using sample data.
   Apply neural networks for regression.
   Build an interactive web application using Streamlit.
   Demonstrate model training, evaluation, and prediction.
